From 542e8abb0602c7f06c18c550ece209b8b28f4459 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stew Forster <stew675@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:09:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/38] WIP mmb: generalize to dense Q4_K/Q5_1, RDNA3 arch
 gate, per-weight-type fusion stand-down

- mmb_dq_row_q4k / mmb_dq_row_q5_1 on-the-fly bf16 LDS dequant (no shadow)
- WTYPE 3 (Q4_K) + 4 (Q5_1) in mmb_tile_gemm and mmb_dense_kernel
- supported_mm accepts Q4_K/Q5_1; K%256 guard for Q4_K
- mmb_enabled() runtime-gated to RDNA3/RDNA3_5 (gfx11 WMMA builtin)
- graph optimizer stands its pair/SWIGLU fusions down on per-weight-type
  predicates (ggml_cuda_mmb_*_will_take) instead of the global gate
- Q4_K_M: pp2048 604->631, pp8192 570->598 (+4.4/+4.9%); PPL 10.333->10.270
